## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Log memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus type-specific extensions:

- **`date`** — ISO-8601 calendar date when the episode occurred (mandatory)
- **`session`** — identifier (commit range, session ID, arc name)
- **`duration`** — rough wall-clock estimate
- **`touches`** — structured list of what the log memorializes (`created` / `updated` / `committed` sub-lists)
- **`handoff-schema-version`** — schema version for the handoff role (logs serve as session-orientation artifacts)

